388
00:24:27,220 --> 00:24:29,520
Similar to glass or metal tempering,

389
00:24:29,620 --> 00:24:32,860
this will ensure that the chocolate solidifies properly.

390
00:24:32,960 --> 00:24:36,800
What that means is it will have a good shine.

391
00:24:36,801 --> 00:24:41,640
It will be hard, and the appearance will last longer.

392
00:24:41,740 --> 00:24:44,740
So the milk chocolate is right over to this area,

393
00:24:44,840 --> 00:24:46,840
