397
00:24:59,560 --> 00:25:02,260
The bars are cooled for about 20 to 30 minutes

398
00:25:02,360 --> 00:25:04,900
and sent to the packaging area.

399
00:25:04,901 --> 00:25:08,140
About 1.9 million bars come off these lines per day.

400
00:25:11,600 --> 00:25:17,540
And of course, there are the Hershey Kisses, and those

401
00:25:17,640 --> 00:25:19,440
decadent Reese's peanut butter cups.

402
00:25:24,360 --> 00:25:26,360
The multi-billion dollar company of today

403
00:25:26,460 --> 00:25:32,900
was started in 1894 by an American innovator determined

404
00:25:32,901 --> 00:25:36,200
