413
00:25:57,600 --> 00:26:02,900
plant here in what is today Hershey, Pennsylvania.

414
00:26:02,901 --> 00:26:07,900
Over a century later, Hershey is synonymous with chocolate.

415
00:26:14,920 --> 00:26:17,940
Hershey's most formidable foe was founded in Tacoma,

416
00:26:18,040 --> 00:26:21,320
