417
00:26:21,420 --> 00:26:24,080
The Mars Corporation started in 1911,

418
00:26:24,180 --> 00:26:26,520
Frank Mars making candy in his kitchen.

419
00:26:26,620 --> 00:26:29,200
He was very successful and moved to Chicago

420
00:26:29,300 --> 00:26:31,600
