425
00:26:47,780 --> 00:26:52,080
Mars added peanuts to nougat and caramel in 1930.

426
00:26:52,180 --> 00:26:55,320
The result became one of the most popular candy bars,

427
00:26:55,420 --> 00:27:01,600
Snickers, with $2 billion in annual retail sales.

428
00:27:01,601 --> 00:27:05,600
Frank's son Forrest continued the family's candy-making

429
00:27:05,680 --> 00:27:09,140
