430
00:27:11,280 --> 00:27:14,780
While on a trip to Spain during the Spanish Civil War, Forrest

431
00:27:14,840 --> 00:27:17,980
encountered soldiers eating pellets of chocolate encased

432
00:27:18,040 --> 00:27:22,060
