433
00:27:24,860 --> 00:27:30,300
In 1941, he introduced M&Ms, ironically made with chocolate

434
00:27:30,301 --> 00:27:34,540
with chocolate supplied by Hershey.

435
00:27:34,640 --> 00:27:38,200
By the late 1940s, M&M's joined the ranks of American chocolate

436
00:27:38,300 --> 00:27:39,140
success stories.

437
00:27:42,040 --> 00:27:44,840
Because the melting point of cocoa butter is just below body

438
00:27:44,940 --> 00:27:48,760
temperature, the candy coating is applied as a barrier to

439
00:27:48,860 --> 00:27:52,560
ensure that M&M's will always melt in your mouth, not in your

440
00:27:52,660 --> 00:27:53,360
hand.

