00:28:35,500 --> 00:28:39,340
A square centimeter of lesion is able to produce

454
00:28:39,440 --> 00:28:43,320
44 millions of spores.

455
00:28:43,420 --> 00:28:46,760
One spore could equal one lost pod.

456
00:28:46,860 --> 00:28:50,560
Through the math, the effects are devastating.

