465
00:29:21,060 --> 00:29:24,360
In association with the member-funded World Cocoa

466
00:29:24,460 --> 00:29:27,600
Foundation, these researchers are developing sturdy

467
00:29:27,601 --> 00:29:31,600
sturdier cocoa plants that will ultimately benefit everyone.

468
00:29:57,600 --> 00:30:01,480
but also for the consumers that need to have this delicious

469
00:30:01,580 --> 00:30:04,640
product in their mouth.

470
00:30:04,740 --> 00:30:05,780
He's right.

471
00:30:05,880 --> 00:30:07,940
What could be better than chocolate?

472
00:30:08,040 --> 00:30:10,480
How about chocolate inside of chocolate?

473
00:30:18,520 --> 00:30:21,320
Chocolate can taste especially great when wrapped around other

474
00:30:21,420 --> 00:30:22,420
stuff that tastes great.

475
00:30:25,060 --> 00:30:27,600
For the everyman, perhaps a peanut butter cup.

476
00:30:27,601 --> 00:30:32,140
For the connoisseur, a fine handmade truffle, traditionally

477
00:30:32,240 --> 00:30:35,840
a soft chocolate center coated in hard chocolate or cocoa

478
00:30:35,940 --> 00:30:36,640
powder.

