00:30:40,440 --> 00:30:43,680
But the frugal aficionado can split the difference and buy

480
00:30:43,780 --> 00:30:47,560
truffles expertly mass-produced by Lindt and Sprungli.

481
00:30:47,561 --> 00:30:48,560
Sprungly.

482
00:30:55,560 --> 00:30:59,560
We see Lindt as a daily affordable luxury.

483
00:30:59,561 --> 00:31:04,560
We don't believe that good chocolate is only designed or

484
00:31:04,561 --> 00:31:06,560
