00:31:31,541 --> 00:31:35,720
And we grind them, roast them, process them in a dedicated

493
00:31:35,721 --> 00:31:38,520
plant in Switzerland.

494
00:31:38,521 --> 00:31:42,480
And we ship out the chocolate mass in a one metric ton block,

495
00:31:42,481 --> 00:31:46,020
2,200 pounds of solid chocolate mass, to the manufacturing

496
00:31:46,021 --> 00:31:46,920
facilities.

497
00:31:50,760 --> 00:31:52,460
Lindstratham, New Hampshire, plant

498
00:31:52,461 --> 00:31:56,300
